#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "timeouts"
msgstr "tempos límite"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can set timeout values. You might want to tweak them if your "
"connection is very slow, but the default settings are appropriate for most "
"users."
msgstr ""
"Aquí pode estabelecer os valores do tempo límite Pode interesarlle "
"aumentalos se a conexión é moi lenta, pero os valores predeterminados son "
"axeitados para a maioría dos usuarios."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here <guilabel>Timeout Values</guilabel> are the length of time an "
"application should wait for an answer from a network operation."
msgstr ""
"Neste contexto <guilabel>Tempo límite</guilabel> é o que un aplicativo debe "
"agardar unha resposta dunha operación de rede."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can configure the following timeouts:"
msgstr "Pode axustar os seguintes tempos:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "Socket read:"
msgstr "Lectura do socket:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some applications use <firstterm>sockets</firstterm> to communicate. You can "
"think of a socket as a water tap; while it is open, water (or in our case, "
"data) comes out, without any interaction. If something stops this flow of "
"data, the application will wait for more to come. This could be a very long "
"time, but you can configure a maximum time for an application to wait with "
"this option."
msgstr ""
"Algúns aplicativos usan <firstterm>sockets</firstterm> para comunicarse. Os "
"sockets son como billas: se están abertas a auga (neste caso os datos) saen, "
"sen interacción, pero se algo corta o fluxo da auga o aplicativo ha agardar "
"que veña máis. Isto pode tardar moito, pero pode estabelecer un tempo máximo "
"de espera mediante esta opción."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "This setting will only apply to &kde; applications, of course."
msgstr "Esta opción só se aplicará aos aplicativos de &kde;."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "Proxy connect:"
msgstr "Conexión co proxy:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sets how long to wait for a connection to a proxy server, if one is "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"Indica canto tempo agardar pola conexión cun servidor proxy, de haber algún "
"configurado."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "Server connect:"
msgstr "Conexión co servidor:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets how long to wait for a connection to a remote server."
msgstr "Indica canto tempo agardar pola conexión cun servidor remoto."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "Server response:"
msgstr "Resposta do servidor:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets how long to wait for a reply from a remote server."
msgstr "Indica canto tempo agardar polas respostas dun servidor remoto."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can configure <guilabel>FTP Options</guilabel> here. At present there is "
"just two options:"
msgstr ""
"Aquí pode configurar as <guilabel>Opcións do FTP</guilabel>. Na actualidade "
"só hai dúas:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable passive mode (PASV)"
msgstr "Activar o modo pasivo (PASV)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Passive &FTP; is often required when you are behind a firewall. Many "
"firewalls only permit connections that were initiated from <quote>the "
"inside</quote>. Passive &FTP; is controlled by the client, which makes it "
"usable through firewalls."
msgstr ""
"Moitas veces requírese de &FTP; pasivo cando se está detrás dunha devasa. E "
"moitas devasas só permiten a conexión de iniciarse desde <quote>dentro</"
"quote>. O &FTP; pasivo contrólao o cliente, o que o fai usábel a través das "
"devasas…"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mark partially uploaded files"
msgstr "Marcar os ficheiros parcialmente enviados"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When a mark is placed in this box, partially uploaded files will have a "
"<literal role=\"extension\">.part</literal> extension added to the end of "
"the file. This extension is removed once the file download is complete."
msgstr ""
"Se escolle esta opción háselle engadir a extensión <literal "
"role=\"extension\">.part </literal> aos ficheiros parcialmente enviados. "
"Háselles retirar unha vez remate a descarga."

